  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Footprinting is a first step in the evaluation of the security posture
    of the target organization\u2019s IT infrastructure. Through footprinting and
    reconnaissance, one can gather maximum information about a computer system or
    a network and about any devices connected to that network. In other words, footprinting
    provides security profile blueprint for an organization, and should be undertaken
    in a methodological manner. This unit will provide an introduction to footprinting
    concepts and insight into footprinting methodology. We will discusses footprinting
    tools and countermeasures. We will conclude with an overview of penetration (\u2018pen\u2019)
    testing steps that an ethical hacker should follow to perform the security assessment
    of a target."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2a97c72100ce9a34eb2d3c2e68bca265, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -125535016509903392, guid: 2a97c72100ce9a34eb2d3c2e68bca265, type: 2}
